{"guid":"grp-103-7","timestamp_unix_ms":1747936892290,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Lady Lucas began directly to calculate, with more interest than the matter had ever \"So much love and eloquence\" excited before, how many years longer Mr.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-103-8","timestamp_unix_ms":1751623146229,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13016423047","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" \"Oh, it is of no consequence.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-103-9","timestamp_unix_ms":1755238252496,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+813856040795","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Could he expect that her friends would not step forward?  \"We will be down as soon as we can,\" said Jane; \"but I dare say Kitty is forwarder than either of us, for she went upstairs half an hour ago.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-103-10","timestamp_unix_ms":1758796360960,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13018162024","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I am so grieved for him.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-103-11","timestamp_unix_ms":1762300860878,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+18589706798","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"He is just what a young-man ought to be,\" said she, \"sensible, good-humoured, lively; and I never saw such happy manners!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
